// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_dnscmd_discovery.yml
// ID Sigma: b6457d63-d2a2-4e29-859d-4e7affc153d1
// Título: Potential Discovery Activity Via Dnscmd.EXE
// Descripción: Detects an attempt to leverage dnscmd.exe to enumerate the DNS zones of a domain. DNS zones used to host the DNS records for a particular domain.
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_dnscmd_discovery.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\dnscmd.exe" and (ProcessCommandLine contains "/enumrecords" or ProcessCommandLine contains "/enumzones" or ProcessCommandLine contains "/ZonePrint" or ProcessCommandLine contains "/info")
